function [laws] = fq_laws()
%FQ_LAWS  The laws the certificate judges, by the flight software's number (fswchoice's MtqAlg, the configuration's mtq_law):
%   PD, rate damping, Lovera-Astolfi 2004, Celani 2015, Avanzini 2021 (nadir), Celani 2026 boresight and TANGO
